<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The system window of the qol client (the System button; it replaces TSe_SystemForm's Form_System_2, whose words are
     painted into its picture); view model: viewmodels/system/SettingsWindow.cpp.  Made of the game's own pictures: the
     white form frame (form_module), blank buttons with captions as tabs (Btn_Module_2), the blue box (panel10), the
     original's switches, arrows, volume bars and menu buttons.  Four tabs: Game (the server's switches, the camera, the
     sort buttons, more accounts, the character information, the black list, the online tips), Sound (music and sound effects), Chat (the channels, the chat
     box, the channels' colours) and Video (extra-settings.json); below them what the menu did: back to a spot, the password,
     the balance, Log Out and Exit. -->
